mod-ws-bridge (1.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Forked from mod_audio_stream (MIT).
  * Added full-duplex playback: downlink WebSocket audio is injected into
    the channel via SMBF_WRITE_REPLACE with a bounded jitter buffer.
  * Added {"type":"clear"} control frame for barge-in playback flush.

